{
  "$defs": {
    "MediaReadJobState": {
      "description": "`media_read_jobs.state` 的契约镜像（与 `domains/media/jobs.JobState` 同值）。\n\n## 为什么契约里再写一份\n\n契约是**对外**的词表，域内的枚举是**实现**。两边直接共用一个类型会让\n\"改实现\"变成\"改 API\"——而这两个变化的影响面完全不同（前者可能要迁移\n历史行，后者前端会炸）。所以契约这里显式列一遍，并有测试断言两边**逐字\n相同**：多一个少一个都会红。",
      "enum": [
        "pending",
        "running",
        "succeeded",
        "failed",
        "unknown",
        "timeout",
        "cancelled",
        "expired",
        "budget_denied"
      ],
      "title": "MediaReadJobState",
      "type": "string"
    }
  },
  "$id": "https://ling.local/contracts/v1/MediaReadJobOut.schema.json",
  "additionalProperties": false,
  "description": "一次视频后台取证作业的**当前状态**（登记返回 202，查询返回同形状）。\n\n## 三条文案纪律（裁决 §3）\n\n1. **入队不等于读到结果**：`state=pending` 的 `note` 只能是\"已安排，尚未\n   读到结果\"，不许出现\"看完了/我看到了\"这类已完成语。文案由**服务端**\n   固定映射，前端直接显示 `note`，不要自己拼。\n2. `unknown` **不等于失败**：它的文案必须说\"不确定\"，因为模型可能已经\n   调用过、只是结果没落库。把它说成失败会让人以为可以安全重试，而重试\n   可能第二次收费。\n3. `error_code` 是稳定码（给日志与测试），人话在 `note` 里。",
  "properties": {
    "call_id": {
      "maxLength": 128,
      "minLength": 1,
      "title": "Call Id",
      "type": "string"
    },
    "cancel_requested_at": {
      "anyOf": [
        {
          "format": "date-time",
          "type": "string"
        },
        {
          "type": "null"
        }
      ],
      "default": null,
      "title": "Cancel Requested At"
    },
    "completed_at": {
      "anyOf": [
        {
          "format": "date-time",
          "type": "string"
        },
        {
          "type": "null"
        }
      ],
      "default": null,
      "title": "Completed At"
    },
    "deadline": {
      "anyOf": [
        {
          "format": "date-time",
          "type": "string"
        },
        {
          "type": "null"
        }
      ],
      "default": null,
      "title": "Deadline"
    },
    "error_code": {
      "anyOf": [
        {
          "type": "string"
        },
        {
          "type": "null"
        }
      ],
      "default": null,
      "title": "Error Code"
    },
    "evidence_id": {
      "maxLength": 128,
      "minLength": 1,
      "title": "Evidence Id",
      "type": "string"
    },
    "feedback_mode": {
      "title": "Feedback Mode",
